menu "meshfind core"

    config MESHFIND_CRYPTO_MBEDTLS
        bool "Use mbedTLS for SHA-256 / ChaCha20-Poly1305 / X25519"
        default n
        help
            By default the portable reference implementation (the exact code
            that is vector-tested on the host) is used. Enabling this uses the
            mbedTLS shipped with ESP-IDF instead (hardware SHA). It requires
            CONFIG_MBEDTLS_CHACHA20_C, CONFIG_MBEDTLS_POLY1305_C,
            CONFIG_MBEDTLS_CHACHAPOLY_C and
            CONFIG_MBEDTLS_ECP_DP_CURVE25519_ENABLED (see
            sdkconfig.defaults.mbedtls). Not yet validated on hardware.

endmenu
